<p dir=3D"auto">Hilarious, I have 1+ years of exp with hooks, especially us=
eEffect looked absolutely discovered.<br>
And today I found, that return of useEffect's callback is not exact analogu=
e of componentDidUnmount. Its just clean-up before re-use of the same effec=
t.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto">Like on 8 interviews I answered that its the same as compon=
entDidUnmount and nobody corrected me, maybe they are also were wrong...</p=
>
</blockquote>
